gate: OPEN
v:4 role:dev x:frontend
task: S89 T10 — List work outside the mobile app
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV]
sprint: S89

context: |
  Write this after T9. Record only gaps the mobile sprint cannot close.
  Seed, drop a line if the device check shows it is already fixed:

  Backend:
  - savevea ignores a full client body, or the event engine ignores speedingValue.
  - track/daily omits the overnight segment, so the app cannot show 00:00.
  - Push tray text is the server title/body. A killed app cannot rebuild
    four lines or translate eventNameRu. Server must send a data payload
    (eventName, value, lat, lng, vehicleId, address, eventTime) and
    localized text, or data-only so the app composes the tray.
  - Token register sends timezone and no language. uk/en tray text needs
    a language field or server templates.
  - Vehicle ВН 0394 МР Краснощек has no CAN keys in vehicleDatas.
    Ingest, vehicledatatypes, or the CAN parser for that tracker.

  Not the mobile repo:
  - Web Cloud screen for full vehicle data and CAN.
  - Native notification click, if tauri-plugin-fcm has no click event.
  - Slope and other pushes whose rich text is composed on the server.

steps:
  1. Read T8 notes and the T9 report. Keep a seed line only if it failed
     or was out of repo.
  2. Write sprints/89/S89-OUTSIDE-MOBILE.md with owner (backend, Cloud,
     native plugin) and the evidence (request, payload, or missing key).
  3. Do not change application source in this task.

out:
  - sprints/89/S89-OUTSIDE-MOBILE.md

done:
  - The file lists each remaining item, who owns it, and why the app cannot close it.
  - Items the device check passed are absent from the list.
